{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1226352,\"title\":\"Free Child\",\"tagline\":\"YES THEORY SHORT FILM WITH GOOGLE\",\"overview\":\"From leaving Egypt 10 years ago, to almost dying a month ago in a car accident. This film is about the journey in between and the massive role the internet played in the life of prominent Youtuber and Yes Theory co-founder Ammar Kandil.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n03RhHzq0henGZ7M1Lif1TfKZvH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bDp6SAo5tDf4KyZHX5hOg0Tj74D.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2020,\"runtime\":20,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Mads Beier\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2973411,\"name\":\"Mads Beier\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2973408,\"name\":\"Taylor Jenisch\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2973365,\"name\":\"Ammar Kandil\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mu3yY9VOjLpXNLEDoUtKMdzukmu.jpg\"},{\"id\":2359726,\"name\":\"Thomas Brag\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t654JWCi0HuMnRx8yssrXomXhtP.jpg\"},{\"id\":2973368,\"name\":\"Matt Dajer\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h42GgzQmApiSRyBKO2V6gzEqRMS.jpg\"},{\"id\":2888,\"name\":\"Will Smith\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8TlKqbXYgHmmaEoPBJ7djJ8Rxxa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1252153,\"name\":\"Wim Hof\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iaebWQRqGu6UC2nOzwt9jjNJD8G.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":664280,\"title\":\"David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSKwyUDKDHiFU5syTTvQRDcGBPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHL4pwGzYS4njLpXhIjfc9skAQJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":656690,\"title\":\"The Social Dilemma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcaM6V2tCtu6iMHDsGLBUbaYgYp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iYqoT9VBGdGTuLl3cjfbG7ZXDkP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary-drama hybrid explores the dangerous human impact of social networking, with tech experts sounding the alarm on their own creations.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1430,\"title\":\"Bowling for Columbine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4XsiTsZcNCRSkee1o0fdr5OqYRT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/70uUnpfe7en9x011UjpZoub101l.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is not a film about gun control. It is a film about the fearful heart and soul of the United States, and the 280 million Americans lucky enough to have the right to a constitutionally protected Uzi. From a look at the Columbine High School security camera tapes to the home of Oscar-winning NRA President Charlton Heston, from a young man who makes homemade napalm with The Anarchist's Cookbook to the murder of a six-year-old girl by another six-year-old. Bowling for Columbine is a journey through the US, through our past, hoping to discover why our pursuit of happiness is so riddled with violence.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1426306,\"title\":\"Titan: The OceanGate Submersible Disaster\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mSVJI9P5UmvOLZVTH8sAtlgxsgy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cBRDacpg1Q6ZOKSxrOhhgkKx9NI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"OceanGate's Titan tourist submersible imploded in 2023 on a deep-sea dive to the Titanic. This documentary details how a bold vision ended in tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8885,\"title\":\"Waltz with Bashir\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zQaCv7lKwHsh0YSHkt1QNjIOZ1c.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMoiIk3tD6qshxccYRjjym7l5YV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A film director from Israel interviews fellow veterans of the 1982 invasion of Lebanon to reconstruct his own memories of his term of service in that conflict.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":469019,\"title\":\"Jim & Andy: The Great Beyond - Featuring a Very Special, Contractually Obligated Mention of Tony Clifton\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kKzopOFXz9YfsCTqg3XpF0GoypX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ORjzDMq26GI82COSnJngXm5Kww.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Through the lens of his stunningly immersive performance as Andy Kaufman, Jim Carrey ponders the meaning of life, reality, identity and career.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":549559,\"title\":\"Apollo 11\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/woLMRroHyoTGoXyxdEeBJEYBFtu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/el4j0LHk56uH6ErE5FZu2x5UJx8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look at the Apollo 11 mission to land on the moon led by commander Neil Armstrong and pilot Buzz Aldrin.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":62320,\"title\":\"Home\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Ph0vzTiORSSlYjsXLFM1OZHkI8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1WKtWXw6yfi5yGknLSvmJLhLa0R.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 200,000 years of existence, man has upset the balance on which the Earth had lived for 4 billion years. Global warming, resource depletion, species extinction: man has endangered his own home. But it is too late to be pessimistic: humanity has barely ten years left to reverse the trend, become aware of its excessive exploitation of the Earth's riches, and change its consumption pattern.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":489931,\"title\":\"American Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLbdKxgxuOPvs6CTlmzoOQ4Yg3j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i28c1bKsnl1O0uqy6HeRWtioOXl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lexington, Kentucky, 2004. Four young men attempt to execute one of the most audacious art heists in the history of the United States.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2359,\"title\":\"Sicko\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8PxUhW78Oy4DWZNRyUkKYmhGUaH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yvqAedtvpEXsc4SKrHQ7DkRLGMZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary about the corrupt health care system in The United States whose main goal is to make profit even if it means losing people’s lives. \\\"The more people you deny health insurance, the more money we make\\\" is the business model for health care providers in America.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1171989,\"title\":\"The Devil on Trial\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qqPIhVKPHePyGqQxbo4gpznsJsA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/DO8hv826sNyll2pW7lW6aShREE.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Explore the first – and only – time “demonic possession” has officially been used as a defense in a U.S. murder trial. Including firsthand accounts of alleged devil possession and a shocking murder, this extraordinary story forces reflection on our fear of the unknown.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1069193,\"title\":\"Four Daughters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iSpJ6fg1OOSO30IUkZskZDufVzN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k7bPM2CFFpJfGgSmY1B9EG9xmnI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Between light and darkness stands Olfa, a Tunisian woman and the mother of four daughters. One day, her two older daughters disappear. To fill in their absence, the filmmaker Kaouther Ben Hania invites professional actresses and invents a unique cinema experience that will lift the veil on Olfa and her daughters' life stories. An intimate journey of hope, rebellion, violence, transmission and sisterhood that will question the very foundations of our societies.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Rt0kp4VW1cI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"vsXs3Km6UDw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"UwSBQWI-bek\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}